# Binary data must never pass through text/EOL normalisation. The committed
# data/pam_microregion_yield_2015_2024.csv.gz was found corrupted (invalid
# gzip stream, SHA-256 different from its own metadata) on 2026-11-03.
*.gz    binary
*.zip   binary
*.tif   binary
*.tiff  binary
*.kmz   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.h5    binary
